# Scored services and what a healthy probe looks like (designs 01, 13).
# Format: name proto host port expect
#   proto  : http | https | dns | smtp | pop3 | ftp | tcp
#   expect : a string the response must contain, or a record value for dns.
#            Use - for "connection and banner only".
# Placeholder hosts and values only.

web-main   http   www.example.test    80   Welcome
dns-main   dns    ns1.example.test    53   www.example.test=192.0.2.20
mail-smtp  smtp   mail.example.test   25   -
mail-pop3  pop3   mail.example.test   110  -
